        },
        "markdown": "# Andrew Kolvet\n\nAmerican media producer and conservative communications figure. Kolvet is publicly identified as Turning Point USA’s national spokesperson and as executive producer of **The Charlie Kirk Show**. Following Charlie Kirk’s death, he also became a co-host of the continuing podcast.\n\nThis graph separates documented biography from claims made in **Bride of Charlie**. The episode remains part of the provenance trail, not independent verification.",
